Attribution: Noel Thomas, "The numbers say chaotic, the database says regular: Inkling 2 Small believes the database"
(2026), https://github.com/11NOel11/inkling-chaos

The dynamical systems and their default parameters come from dysts (William Gilpin,
https://github.com/williamgilpin/dysts). Replies in data/results/models/ come from the model in the file name;
files ending in _haiku come from Claude Haiku 5.5; all other replies come from Inkling 2 Small, base or trained.
